ment_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1410904031:0":{"text":"퀸, 당신은 기생충도 꼭두각시도 아니군요.","source_cn":"奎茵，你不是寄生虫，你也不是傀儡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB730D24B8536D14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1410904032:0":{"text":"당신은 이 피와 살로 세워진 나라의 기둥입니다. 당신은 꼭두각시를 움직이는 실이자, 기생충에게 영양분을 실어 나르는 개미일 뿐이에요.","source_cn":"你是这片血肉国度中的一根梁柱，你是操控傀儡的丝线，你是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A7ADF25CDB090A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1410904033:0":{"text":"맞아... 네 말이 맞아.","source_cn":"没错……我是，我接受你的评价。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA31B37FAA940859A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1410904034:0":{"text":"나는 이 나라에서 살아가고, 은혜의 이슬의 은총을 느끼며 신앙을 가질 수 있는 것만으로도...","source_cn":"能够身处这个国度，能够感受灵露的恩惠，能够拥有这样至高...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1B1EABD2BBE6AC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1410904035:0":{"text":"정말, 행복하단다.","source_cn":"我，非常幸福。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x644E9069A6F6E291","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say: